WEBVTT

00:00:02.203 --> 00:00:07.875
Three chasers, two beaters,
one keeper and a seeker. That's you.

00:00:13.005 --> 00:00:17.134
There are three kinds of balls.
This one's called the quaffle.

00:00:17.343 --> 00:00:23.307
The chasers handle the quaffle and try
to put it through one of those hoops.

00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:27.895
The keeper, that's me,
defends the hoops. With me so far?

00:00:28.104 --> 00:00:32.566
I think so. What are those?

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.029
You better take this.

00:00:47.081 --> 00:00:49.875
Careful now, it's coming back.

00:00:56.424 --> 00:01:00.094
Not bad, Potter.
You'd make a fair beater.

00:01:16.736 --> 00:01:19.030
What was that?

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:23.534
Bludger. Nasty little buggers.

00:01:23.743 --> 00:01:27.246
But you are a seeker.

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:35.421
The only thing I want you
to worry about is this.

00:01:35.671 --> 00:01:38.174
The golden snitch.

00:01:38.382 --> 00:01:41.385
- I like this ball.
- You like it now.

00:01:41.594 --> 00:01:45.598
Just wait. It's wicked fast
and damn near impossible to see.

00:01:45.806 --> 00:01:47.767
What do I do with it?

00:01:47.975 --> 00:01:51.228
You catch it.
Before the other team's seeker.

00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:53.939
You catch this, the game's over.

00:01:54.148 --> 00:01:58.110
You catch this, Potter,
and we win.

00:02:07.161 --> 00:02:12.500
One of a wizard's most rudimentary
skills is levitation...

00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:16.670
Or the ability to make objects fly.

00:02:16.837 --> 00:02:19.298
Do you have your feathers? Good.

00:02:19.507 --> 00:02:24.678
Now, don't forget the nice wrist
movement we've been practicing.

00:02:24.845 --> 00:02:28.224
The swish and flick. Everyone.

00:02:28.766 --> 00:02:34.355
The swish and flick. Good.
Oh, and enunciate.

00:02:35.106 --> 00:02:39.360
Wingardium leviosa.
Off you go, then.

00:02:40.444 --> 00:02:42.947
Wingardium leviosa.

00:02:43.197 --> 00:02:45.533
Wingardium leviosa.

00:02:45.741 --> 00:02:49.203
Wingardium leviosa.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.624
No, stop, stop, stop! You're going
to take someone's eye out.

00:02:53.874 --> 00:02:59.839
Besides, you're saying it wrong.
It's leviosa, not leviosar.

00:03:00.381 --> 00:03:04.635
You do it then, if you're so clever.
Go on, go on.

00:03:05.886 --> 00:03:08.973
Wingardium leviosa.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:22.069
Well done! See here, everyone,
miss Granger's done it!

00:03:22.319 --> 00:03:23.988
Splendid!

00:03:25.573 --> 00:03:27.741
Well done, dear.

00:03:31.996 --> 00:03:36.083
I think we're going to need
another feather over here.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.844
"It's leviosa, not leviosar."

00:03:47.094 --> 00:03:52.433
She's a nightmare, honestly!
No wonder she hasn't got any friends.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.603
I think she heard you.
